  "prefLabel": "Eng 105.02 Quorum",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Eng 105.02 Quorum. A quorum of the board shall consist of a majority of the members appointed by Governor and Counsel. A quorum of the board shall be necessary to pass a motion unless otherwise specified by law. In the absence of the chair or vice chair the chair shall designate a pro tempore officer for the officer or officers absent.\n\nSource. #6910, eff 12-15-98; ss by #13736, eff 10-24-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/eng100.html"
